# GRASS-SETTLE: the first frame after opening FIELD_Barn must not show a grass cell of another colour with a straight
# edge (FOLIAGE-PROOF 10-28, 1_field_grass lower left: a variety drawn with its Pending textures' schema defaults).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_first the first frame after opening, default FOV: no grass cell of another colour with a straight edge (lower left)
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Тогда-вид 2_fov70 FOV 70: the grass is uniform
